{"seq":6,"slug":"sociolinguistics","title":"社会语言学","stage":"DONE","category":"linguistics","chapterCount":3,"docCount":15,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 社会语言学 简介\n\n社会语言学研究语言与社会之间的相互关系，探索语言变异的社会根源、语言使用的社会功能以及语言政策对社会的影响。它揭示了语言不仅是交际工具，更是社会身份、权力关系和文化认同的重要载体。\n\n本手册面向语言学专业学生和对语言社会现象感兴趣的读者，系统介绍社会语言学的核心理论、研究方法和重要议题。读者将学会从社会视角分析语言现象，理解语言多样性背后的社会动因。\n\n全书共分为三章，从语言内部的变异到外部的社会治理逐步展开：\n\n第一章**语言变异**探讨语言在不同维度上的变异现象，包括地域方言与社会方言的形成机制、语域与语体在不同场合的使用差异，以及语言在时间维度上的变化与历史演变规律。\n\n第二章**语言与社会**聚焦语言的社会功能，分析语言如何构建和表达个人与群体身份认同，讨论语言与社会权力之间的复杂关系，并介绍多语社会中语码转换与语言接触的现象。\n\n第三章**语言政策**进入语言治理的宏观领域，讲解语言规划与标准化的目标与方法，讨论语言权利与语言平等的核心议题，并关注全球语言濒危的现状与语言保护的策略。\n\n建议读者从语言变异的具体现象入手，逐步理解其背后的社会机制，再上升到语言政策的宏观视角，形成从微观到宏观的完整认识。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"language-variation","title":"语言变异","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-variation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dialects-sociolects","title":"方言与社会方言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-variation/dialects-sociolects"},{"seq":2,"slug":"register-style","title":"语域与风格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-variation/register-style"},{"seq":3,"slug":"language-change","title":"语言变化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-variation/language-change"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"language-and-society","title":"语言与社会","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"language-identity","title":"语言与身份","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/language-identity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bilingualism-multilingualism","title":"双语与多语社会","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/bilingualism-multilingualism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"language-contact","title":"语言接触","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/language-contact"},{"seq":4,"slug":"language-power","title":"语言与权力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/language-power"},{"seq":5,"slug":"variation-dialect","title":"语言变异与方言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/variation-dialect"},{"seq":6,"slug":"language-power","title":"语言与权力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/language-power"},{"seq":7,"slug":"multilingualism","title":"多语现象与语码转换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-and-society/multilingualism"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"language-policy","title":"语言政策","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-policy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"language-planning","title":"语言规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-policy/language-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"language-rights","title":"语言权利与语言平等","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-policy/language-rights"},{"seq":3,"slug":"language-endangerment","title":"语言濒危与语言保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-policy/language-endangerment"},{"seq":4,"slug":"multilingualism","title":"多语言主义与语言接触","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-policy/multilingualism"},{"seq":5,"slug":"language-planning","title":"语言规划与语言教育政策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-policy/language-planning"}]}]}